1
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:55,540
I know you are that reporter's daughter.

2
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,040
What do you mean?

3
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:08,400
I'm sorry.

4
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,740
I'm really sorry.

5
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:14,539
Reporter Gu's death back then

6
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:16,180
was caused by our family.

7
00:01:17,780 --> 00:01:20,110
Please give me a chance to make it up to you.

8
00:01:21,740 --> 00:01:23,270
How do you know my identity?

9
00:01:25,720 --> 00:01:26,520
Mucheng.

10
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:28,970
She told me everything.

11
00:01:32,039 --> 00:01:33,240
What do you want to do?

12
00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:41,979
I want to cooperate with you.

13
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,800
Send my father to prison.

14
00:01:46,340 --> 00:01:46,979
This...

15
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:49,000
You heard me right.

16
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,330
I will choose justice over family,

17
00:01:51,580 --> 00:01:53,140
no matter the cost.

18
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:55,940
Why?

19
00:01:55,940 --> 00:01:56,759
Because he never

20
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:58,289
treated me like his own son.

21
00:02:04,340 --> 00:02:05,140
Back then,

22
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:09,460
he drove my mother away for his own selfish desires.

23
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,680
Since then,

24
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:14,040
he has ignored me,

25
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,440
putting all his effort...

26
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:17,340
were all poured into

27
00:02:17,340 --> 00:02:18,980
my half-brother.

28
00:02:18,980 --> 00:02:20,940
Be careful not to fall.

29
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,530
Finally, I founded Shengli Media.

30
00:02:31,640 --> 00:02:33,380
Congratulations, Mr. Ling.

31
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:35,540
Congratulations.

32
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:37,070
Congratulations, Mr. Lin.

33
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,280
Just as the company was improving,

34
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,900
it was forcibly taken by him again.

35
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:42,960
What are you doing?

36
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,200
Who let you in?

37
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:58,570
It became one of his tools to consolidate upper-level relationships.

38
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:02,100
Mucheng

39
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:05,000
is one of the victims.

40
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,170
I have always longed for the day

41
00:03:09,740 --> 00:03:13,070
when I can personally seek justice for myself and my mother.

42
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:16,340
Lawyer Gu.

43
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,200
In the phone

44
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,700
is some video evidence

45
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:24,079
recorded by your father before he passed away.

46
00:03:24,079 --> 00:03:25,280
And in this hard drive

47
00:03:25,380 --> 00:03:28,480
is some evidence of the company's financial irregularities.

48
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:29,810
But this evidence alone

49
00:03:30,340 --> 00:03:32,400
is not enough to go against my father.

50
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:35,700
We still need more compelling evidence.

51
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:40,300
Lawyer Gu,

52
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:43,120
the only person who can defeat my father now

53
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:43,900
is you.

54
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:46,980
So I want to ask for your help.

55
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,079
You believed that guy?

56
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,440
I can't figure it out.

57
00:04:23,180 --> 00:04:24,780
I really can't figure it out.

58
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,260
You said based on previous experiences,

59
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,300
Lingze must really hate his dad.

60
00:04:29,980 --> 00:04:32,040
But I didn't think he hated him enough

61
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:34,580
to betray him.

62
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:38,100
He actually handed such important evidence

63
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,360
directly to me.

64
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:43,200
This is enough to convict him.

65
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:45,070
It's really hard to figure out.

66
00:04:46,140 --> 00:04:48,540
Could it be that in the previous timelines,

67
00:04:49,180 --> 00:04:50,980
we complicated things?

68
00:04:55,540 --> 00:04:57,440
Forget it. Let's not think about it.

69
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:58,980
So much has happened today.

70
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,060
Let's get some rest first.

71
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,460
You should go to bed early too.

72
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:08,480
Leave these with me.

73
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:28,000
He called us over so early in the morning.

74
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,460
What does he want to do now?

75
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:42,340
Sorry to keep you waiting.

76
00:05:42,780 --> 00:05:44,540
Mr. Ling, you called us over in such a hurry.

77
00:05:44,540 --> 00:05:45,980
Is there something wrong?

78
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:47,640
I have something to give you.

79
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:52,080
My father has made a new move.

80
00:05:53,380 --> 00:05:56,909
He is preparing to launch a group live broadcast plan this time.

81
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:58,540
This plan

82
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:01,230
was personally designed by my father.

83
00:06:02,340 --> 00:06:04,840
I always feel something is wrong with this group broadcast.

84
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:05,320
So,

85
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:07,280
I want to hear your opinions.

86
00:06:12,980 --> 00:06:14,440
On the surface,

87
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,400
this broadcast plan seems fine.

88
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:19,400
But given what your father did before

89
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:21,000
by using the streamers,

90
00:06:21,140 --> 00:06:22,470
I have reason to suspect

91
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,280
that this new broadcast plan

92
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:26,840
must be hiding some unknown secrets.

93
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:31,200
Then what should I do?

94
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:33,330
To avoid your father's suspicion,

95
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,840
my suggestion is

96
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:37,000
that you proceed with the plan

97
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:39,330
and collect evidence at the same time.

98
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:41,240
Once you find out that those so-called higher-ups

99
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:43,140
really have ulterior motives against the streamers,

100
00:06:43,140 --> 00:06:44,600
take action immediately.

101
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:46,440
Okay, I'll do as you say.

102
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:54,980
Good luck.

103
00:06:57,300 --> 00:06:57,980
I will.

104
00:07:08,340 --> 00:07:10,040
Hello, guys.

105
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:12,040
I'm Mucheng. Long time no see.

106
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,640
Did you miss me?

107
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:17,340
Those rumors on the internet are false.

108
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,680
I'm very happy with the company.

109
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:20,680
From now on,

110
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:23,620
I will meet you all with a new streaming style.

111
00:07:23,940 --> 00:07:25,440
Welcome the new streamer.

112
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,460
Come on, everyone, say hello.

113
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,940
Those people replied.

114
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,200
Take a screenshot first.

115
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:49,940
Okay.

116
00:07:51,340 --> 00:07:52,260
I'll send them all to you later.

117
00:07:52,260 --> 00:07:52,800
Okay.

118
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:08,000
Come on.

119
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,400
Keep up the good work.

120
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:30,640
Mr. Ling.

121
00:08:33,140 --> 00:08:35,380
I really like the new live streaming model.

122
00:08:35,380 --> 00:08:38,039
The girls you paired up are all excellent.

123
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,000
In the future,

124
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:41,659
I will lead them to achieve even better results.

125
00:08:41,740 --> 00:08:42,640
Here's to you.

126
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:56,540
Mr. Ling.

127
00:08:56,860 --> 00:08:58,720
Mr. Wang asked Mucheng to go over.

128
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:00,600
Tell him

129
00:09:01,060 --> 00:09:02,940
today is an internal celebration party.

130
00:09:02,940 --> 00:09:04,470
It's not convenient for me.

131
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:06,740
Mr. Ling.

132
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,400
Mr. Wang is here.

133
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:10,260
It wouldn't be good if we don't receive him, right?

134
00:09:10,260 --> 00:09:11,020
I'm fine.

135
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:11,640
Sit down.

136
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:14,740
I told you to sit down.

137
00:09:18,980 --> 00:09:21,040
Tell them it's not convenient today.

138
00:09:23,780 --> 00:09:24,580
Yes.

139
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:33,130
You don't need to worry about this.

140
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:36,130
Why has she changed so much?

141
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:39,780
Could it be that I was wrong all along?

142
00:09:42,740 --> 00:09:43,900
I just feel like

143
00:09:44,900 --> 00:09:46,040
something is weird.

144
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:50,680
Mr. Ling,

145
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:52,700
you're not giving me any face.

146
00:09:55,780 --> 00:09:56,760
Lao Wang,

147
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:59,480
you didn't even tell me you were coming.

148
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,340
What, am I not welcome?

149
00:10:01,340 --> 00:10:02,140
Of course not.

150
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:03,840
As you can see,

151
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:06,480
this is our company's internal celebration party.

152
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:08,480
How about this? I'll find you later.

153
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:10,880
I just want to have a drink right now.

154
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:12,580
Okay, have a seat.

155
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,050
Chengcheng.

156
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,530
Play some music.

157
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:21,740
Mucheng,

158
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,180
it's only been a few days.

159
00:10:23,180 --> 00:10:25,440
Why are you acting like a stranger again?

160
00:10:25,540 --> 00:10:26,380
Mr. Wang,

161
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:27,840
how could I?

162
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:29,540
Come,

163
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:30,410
have a drink.

164
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:33,060
Mr. Wang, I'll drink with you.

165
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:39,340
Mr. Wang,

166
00:10:39,340 --> 00:10:40,280
come,

167
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:41,940
let me introduce you

168
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,540
to our company's new team.

169
00:10:44,140 --> 00:10:47,340
Each of you must toast Mr. Wang individually.

170
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,460
Did you hear me?

171
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,560
How can I handle all this?

172
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:51,890
Mr. Wang, a toast to you.

173
00:10:52,060 --> 00:10:52,540
Okay.

174
00:10:52,540 --> 00:10:53,580
Okay, bottoms up.

175
00:10:53,580 --> 00:10:55,510
Everyone must finish their drink.

176
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,580
This little girl finished hers.

177
00:10:59,580 --> 00:11:01,080
Come, let me pour you another.

178
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:01,600
Okay.

179
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:04,400
What's your name?

180
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:06,280
Hello, Mr. Wang. I'm Xiaoya.

181
00:11:06,380 --> 00:11:07,140
Sit.

182
00:11:07,140 --> 00:11:07,800
Come.

183
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:10,330
Keep Mr. Wang good company.

184
00:11:10,380 --> 00:11:10,880
Come,

185
00:11:11,340 --> 00:11:12,800
let's have another drink.

186
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:24,560
It's okay.

187
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:31,340
Trust me,

188
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:32,980
it will all be worth it.
